WEBVTT

00:06:57.997 --> 00:07:01.542
And there’s the Brazilian dragon mantis;

00:07:01.584 --> 00:07:04.879
the flower bud mantis; the unicorn.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:10.301
But of course, rainforest
isn't just a fantasy wonderland.

00:07:10.342 --> 00:07:12.636
"What if you are afraid of the dark?"

00:07:12.678 --> 00:07:13.888
you might be wondering.

00:07:13.929 --> 00:07:17.057
Well, the answer is the same
among explorers.

00:07:17.558 --> 00:07:18.976
Out there,

00:07:19.018 --> 00:07:22.563
surrounded by all kinds of creatures,

00:07:22.605 --> 00:07:25.065
the only thing we fear

00:07:25.065 --> 00:07:26.233
is mankind.

00:07:26.901 --> 00:07:28.360
And when we are back home,

00:07:28.402 --> 00:07:31.947
we fear that the next time
we visit the rainforest again,